---- MODULE live_reset__unfair__always_action_tuple ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x' = IF x = 0 THEN 2 ELSE x - 1
Spec == x = 2 /\ [][Next]_x
Prop == [][x' = x + 1]_<<x>>
====

